.TH "ORBIT" "1" "Aug 2026" "Orbit Developer Platform" "Orbit Platform Manual"

.SH NAME
orbit-release-prod - Merge the open release pull request through the merge gate


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBorbit release prod  [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Merges the open release pull request through the same gate as 'orbit pr merge'. For a Changesets library it then dispatches publish.yml; the owner still approves the npm-publish environment and the CLI never approves it.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--allow-no-checks\fP[=false]
	Allow a release or Renovate pull request that reports no checks to merge

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for prod

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	Print the result as a JSON envelope

.PP
\fB--method\fP="merge"
	Merge method (merge, squash, rebase, rebase-merge)

.PP
\fB--override\fP=""
	Merge despite failing checks and record the reason as a PR comment


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--config\fP=""
	Custom path to Orbit CLI configuration file

.PP
\fB--manifest\fP=""
	Path to workspace.yaml


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBorbit-release(1)\fP
